# Tasker script location

File-based Tasker scripts live on the phone at `/sdcard/Tasker/scripts/`.

In a JavaScript action the path is `Tasker/scripts/filename.js`. Do not put these scripts in `/sdcard/Download`. After changing a script, copy it to `/sdcard/Tasker/scripts/` on the Pixel.
